  'flare-compensation-implanted': 'An implanted version of flare compensation, protecting your vision from sudden bright light.',
  'image-link-implanted': 'An implanted receiver for AR image feeds sent directly to your eyes.',
  'low-light-vision-implanted': 'An implanted version of low-light vision, letting you see clearly in dim conditions.',
  'retinal-duplication': 'An illegal implant that can be loaded with a recorded retina scan to fool retinal scanners.',
  'smartlink-implanted': 'An implanted smartlink for smartgun-equipped weapons — more effective than an external smartlink device.',
  'thermographic-vision-implanted': 'An implanted version of thermographic vision, letting you see heat signatures.',
